/S /H2
/P 92 0 R
/T (Beyond facial recognition, the system introduces secure workspaces, digital identity cards, and dynamic QR-based attendance as adaptable layers within a unified architecture. These components allow CognitoAttend to operate reliably across classrooms, institutions, and events while supporting real-time analytics and reporting.)
/E (Beyond facial recognition, the system introduces secure workspaces, digital identity cards, and dynamic QR-based attendance as adaptable layers within a unified architecture. These components allow CognitoAttend to operate reliably across classrooms, institutions, and events while supporting real-time analytics and reporting.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
