/E (What distinguishes CognitoAttend is its engineering philosophy. The project prioritizes logic over dependency, execution over convenience, and architectural clarity over repetition. Built within strict time constraints, it demonstrates that impactful, scalable, and privacy-aware AI systems can be achieved through thoughtful design rather than heavy stacks.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
