<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The CognitoAttend Registration Portal enables quick and secure user onboarding using AI-powered facial recognition. Users are registered within a selected workspace to ensure organized and isolated data management. A secure magic registration link, valid for 5 minutes, is generated to prevent unauthorized access. Users enter basic details and capture a live facial image through the camera. The system securely encodes and stores facial data for accurate identification. Upon successful registration, instant confirmation is provided. This ensures reliable, secure, and proxy-free attendance tracking from the very first scan.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
